'''Vs Katsumi Orochi''' (VS愚地克巳, ''Orochi Katsumi'', '''VS Katsumi Orochi''') is a [[Baki Hanma Collaboration Event|Hanma Baki: Son of Ogre]] collaboration stage added in the [[Version 14.3 Update]]. The boss of this Gauntlet is [[Katsumi Orochi (Enemy)|Katsumi Orochi]].

==Overview==
===About===
Vs Katsumi Orochi contains a total of 10 [[No Continues]] levels, called '''Beyond Supersonic Lv'''. After beating three stages, the player must wait for 90 minutes before they may proceed to the next one (30 minutes for one available). Rewards for the first completion of a Beyond Supersonic can include [[Battle Items]] and Legend Dumbbells. The rewards reset with every appearance of the event.

===Stage Battlegrounds===
:''See [[Vs Katsumi Orochi/Beyond Supersonic Lv.1~10]].''

==Play Requirements==
*VS愚地克巳 is unlocked after clearing [[Empire of Cats]] Chapter 3.

